    "text": "By Hazard Herald Staff Report ,\n1 days ago LEXINGTON — The KHSAA Board of Control voted 13-5 to adopt a shot clock for boys' and girls' basketball beginning in the 2027-28 seasons during its second regularly scheduled meeting of the 2025-26 academic year on Wednesday, Sept. 17. Thirty-two state associations throughout the nation currently use a shot... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
